              <p>You've been dreaming about a complete house renovation for months — or building a new home for years. Maybe it's a kitchen with premium custom cabinets and a layout that finally works for your family. Maybe it's a second-story addition or mudroom cabinetry that solves years of clutter. Finding the right general contractor is the decision that determines whether your vision becomes reality — or becomes a cautionary story. In 2026, when budgets are tight and good contractors book out months ahead, knowing who to call and what to look for matters more than ever.</p>
            </div>

